{
  "uid": "sre-lab-kubernetes",
  "title": "SRE Lab · Kubernetes",
  "description": "单节点 K3s 集群监控。独立数据源 uid=kubernetes；cluster 是此数据源的静态集群标识，不依赖只用于外部通信的 Prometheus externalLabels。查询兼容 kube-prometheus-stack 93.3.1 的 kubelet/node-exporter 抓取标签。",
  "tags": [
    "sre",
    "lab",
    "kubernetes"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "label": "集群（独立数据源）",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "sre-lab-k3s",
        "current": {
          "text": "sre-lab-k3s",
          "value": "sre-lab-k3s",
          "selected": true
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "sre-lab-k3s",
            "value": "sre-lab-k3s",
            "selected": true
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "skipUrlSync": true
      },
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "命名空间",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "kubernetes"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(kube_namespace_status_phase, namespace)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(kube_namespace_status_phase, namespace)",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all",
          "selected": true
        },
        "options": [],
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Kubernetes 集群概览",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**集群：${cluster}** · 仅使用独立的 Kubernetes 数据源。命名空间筛选作用于 Pod、Deployment 和 PVC；节点与抓取状态始终显示全群集。\n\n先检查抓取状态：**1 = 成功，0 = 失败；无数据不代表 0 或健康**。Waiting 空表也可能表示暂无等待容器，请结合抓取状态判断。PVC 不存在或存储驱动未提供卷统计时，容量/用量面板显示无数据。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "节点 Ready",
      "description": "来自 Kubernetes 节点 Ready condition。0 包含未就绪和未知状态；无数据时不能判定节点健康。",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kubernetes"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (node) (kube_node_status_condition{condition=\"Ready\",status=\"true\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kubernetes"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "无数据",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "未就绪 / 未知",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Ready",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "interval": "30s",
      "maxDataPoints": 600
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "节点 CPU 使用率",
      "description": "所有逻辑 CPU 的平均非 idle 比例，包含 iowait；不是 CPU 核数。至少需要两个抓取样本。",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kubernetes"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 9,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (1 - avg by (instance) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{job=\"node-exporter\",mode=\"idle\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kubernetes"
          },
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "无数据",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "max": 100,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisCenteredZero": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "interval": "30s",
      "maxDataPoints": 600
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "节点内存使用率",
      "description": "按 1 - MemAvailable / MemTotal 计算，反映可用内存余量；不把 Linux 可回收页缓存全部当作占用。",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kubernetes"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 15,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 9,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (1 - max by (instance) (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{job=\"node-exporter\"}) / max by (instance) (node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{job=\"node-exporter\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kubernetes"
          },
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "无数据",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "max": 100,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisCenteredZero": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "interval": "30s",
      "maxDataPoints": 600
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "节点文件系统使用率",
      "description": "按普通进程可用空间计算；排除内存、容器 overlay、运行时及 Pod 挂载目录，保留主机持久文件系统。",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kubernetes"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (1 - max by (instance, device, mountpoint) (node_filesystem_avail_bytes{job=\"node-exporter\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|devtmpfs|overlay|squashfs|nsfs|tracefs|proc|sysfs|cgroup2?|autofs\",mountpoint!~\"/run(/.*)?|.*/kubelet/pods/.*\"}) / max by (instance, device, mountpoint) (node_filesystem_size_bytes{job=\"node-exporter\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|devtmpfs|overlay|squashfs|nsfs|tracefs|proc|sysfs|cgroup2?|autofs\",mountpoint!~\"/run(/.*)?|.*/kubelet/pods/.*\"} > 0))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{mountpoint}} {{device}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kubernetes"
          },
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "无数据",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "max": 100,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisCenteredZero": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "interval": "30s",
      "maxDataPoints": 600
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Prometheus 抓取状态",
      "description": "当前 Kubernetes Prometheus 的所有已发现目标。1=成功，0=失败；目标未被发现时不会出现一行 0，不能据此确认采集齐全。",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kubernetes"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min by (job, instance, endpoint, metrics_path) (up)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kubernetes"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "无数据",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Value"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "DOWN",
                        "color": "red"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "UP",
                        "color": "green"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": []
      },
      "interval": "30s",
      "maxDataPoints": 600,
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true
            },
            "indexByName": {},
            "renameByName": {}
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Pod 阶段分布",
      "description": "当前各 phase 的 Pod 数量。Running 仅表示阶段，不能替代容器就绪或业务健康检查。",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kubernetes"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (phase) (max by (namespace, pod, phase) (kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=~\"${namespace:regex}\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "{{phase}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kubernetes"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "无数据",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "showUnfilled": false,
        "valueMode": "color"
      },
      "interval": "30s",
      "maxDataPoints": 600
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "容器 Waiting 原因 · 含 CrashLoopBackOff",
      "description": "仅列出当前 Waiting=1 的容器及原因，例如 CrashLoopBackOff、ImagePullBackOff、ContainerCreating；空表不等于已证明健康。",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kubernetes"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (namespace, pod, container, reason) (kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{namespace=~\"${namespace:regex}\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kubernetes"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "无数据",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": []
      },
      "interval": "30s",
      "maxDataPoints": 600,
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true
            },
            "indexByName": {},
            "renameByName": {}
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Pod CPU · 每个采样点 Top 10",
      "description": "汇总 Pod 内应用容器 CPU，单位为 CPU 核；排除空容器与基础设施 POD 容器。曲线不代表相对于 CPU limit 的百分比。",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kubernetes"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (namespace, pod) (max by (namespace, pod, container) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{job=\"kubelet\",metrics_path=\"/metrics/cadvisor\",namespace=~\"${namespace:regex}\",pod!=\"\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"}[$__rate_interval]))))",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}} / {{pod}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kubernetes"
          },
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "无数据",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "axisLabel": "CPU 核",
            "axisCenteredZero": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "interval": "30s",
      "maxDataPoints": 600
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Pod 内存工作集 · 每个采样点 Top 10",
      "description": "汇总应用容器的 working set；并非内存 limit，也不能据此直接判定 OOM。",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kubernetes"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (namespace, pod) (max by (namespace, pod, container) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{job=\"kubelet\",metrics_path=\"/metrics/cadvisor\",namespace=~\"${namespace:regex}\",pod!=\"\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"})))",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}} / {{pod}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kubernetes"
          },
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "无数据",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisCenteredZero": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "interval": "30s",
      "maxDataPoints": 600
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Pod 最近 1 小时重启增量 · Top 10",
      "description": "由容器 restart counter 的 increase 估算，可能出现小数；窗口固定为最近 1 小时。无数据与没有重启不同。",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kubernetes"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (namespace, pod) (max by (namespace, pod, container) (increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=~\"${namespace:regex}\"}[1h]))))",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}} / {{pod}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kubernetes"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "无数据",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "showUnfilled": false,
        "valueMode": "color"
      },
      "interval": "30s",
      "maxDataPoints": 600
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Pod 当前 phase",
      "description": "每个 Pod 当前为 1 的 phase。容器 Waiting 原因见上方；CrashLoopBackOff 是容器等待原因，不是 Pod phase。",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kubernetes"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (namespace, pod, phase) (kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=~\"${namespace:regex}\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kubernetes"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "无数据",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": []
      },
      "interval": "30s",
      "maxDataPoints": 600,
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true
            },
            "indexByName": {},
            "renameByName": {}
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Deployment 期望 / 可用副本",
      "description": "对比 spec.replicas 与 available replicas。单节点资源不足、滚动更新或探针失败都可能导致可用副本低于期望；不将缺失序列补为 0。",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kubernetes"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (namespace, deployment) (kube_deployment_spec_replicas{namespace=~\"${namespace:regex}\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}} / {{deployment}} · 期望",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kubernetes"
          },
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "max by (namespace, deployment) (kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{namespace=~\"${namespace:regex}\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}} / {{deployment}} · 可用",
          "datasource": {
